TanStack Start project. File-based routes in `src/routes/`, root layout in `src/routes/__root.tsx`.
Import alias `@/*` maps to `src/*`.
{{#unless (or (has "deployment" "cloudflare") (has "deployment" "cloudflare-static"))}}

`build` emits a Nitro server to `.output/`. `start` runs it with Node, which loads `.env` when it exists, then `.env.start` (the app's default `PORT`, which wins over a `PORT` in `.env`). A variable exported in the shell wins over both files.
{{/unless}}
